:"blogs_podcasts","summary":"Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的 Web Answer 现已正式可用。开发者只需调用一次工具，即可获得基于当前网页信息、由模型综合生成并附带来源链接的回答，无需自行搭建搜索、检索、内容清洗和引用提取流程。","title":"Getting started with Web Answer on Amazon Bedrock AgentCore"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_68cee360942b7e8efa12f49664464d286d4222103c8afad6fa67d9b2060e61b1","internal_url":"/posts/20261106-arxiv-swarmevolve-latent-agent-swarms-for-evolutionary-d-0-6f7078b324/","observation_id":"obs_6f7078b324b1954466218c0ab514603989f805fdd1c106f8621d9fda98e8288f","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:59:29Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"SwarmEvolve 是一种利用大规模智能体群体进行进化式搜索的方法，让智能体在隐空间协作、共享 KV 缓存信息，并结合新颖性筛选与隐式交叉来生成和优化程序。实验显示，它在数学发现与科学计算任务上以更短时间取得了较高平均分。","title":"SwarmEvolve: Latent Agent Swarms for Evolutionary Discovery and Optimization"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_88a612f2b9d9e09fe85c32779b74d6a4a0ca737140afc675eb60eac1496e994b","internal_url":"/posts/20261107-arxiv-xstack-a-benchmark-for-ml-repo-migration-0-c506adad28/","observation_id":"obs_c506adad28825d2b4f3de3c5e292070bbd219fb1a6fa5dc04956dc9de5be67a4","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:55:54Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"XStack 是一个用于评估 AI 代理跨框架、跨硬件迁移机器学习代码仓库的基准。代理需要把 PyTorch 仓库迁移为可在 TPU 上运行的 JAX 仓库，并通过基于原仓库结果的校准评分。","title":"XStack: A Benchmark for ML Repo Migration"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_d9826a69ee6bd32f994d304dae3fc4640f1d9d54e6bf7c49de5340934fde7cc0","internal_url":"/posts/20261108-arxiv-reprobridge-building-reproducibility-into-ml-resea-2-5d920b8c07/","observation_id":"obs_5d920b8c0784633371b19f05fcbc35b545ad7b7b847e7f7676f28bda4f20be55","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:45:36Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"ReproBridge 将代码、环境配置、实验启动器和复现指南整合成标准化制品，并通过智能体工作流保存实验过程中的操作知识与决策。其目标是提升机器学习实验的独立复现成功率。","title":"ReproBridge: Building Reproducibility into ML Research Artifacts"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_0d40ab33453c1ffd45f8b8479389ebf75d40c8739f45f4bca22caeb204d73530","internal_url":"/posts/20261106-blogs_podcasts-how-amazon-marketplace-evaluates-content-quality-w-1-fad370bb7b/","observation_id":"obs_fad370bb7b6d436415c6f4ddb8a02e1562eca0569d93ed1a33f1eed45345207d","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:06:43Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这篇文章介绍一种面向电商商品详情页的内容质量评估方案：用视觉语言模型理解整页图片、文字与布局的协同效果，再结合 OCR 可读性信号和 CatBoost 分类器，依据专家标注输出质量判断。方案还利用 SHAP 解释评分依据，并在 Amazon SageMaker AI 上覆盖数据接入、模型托管、监控等环节。","title":"How Amazon Marketplace evaluates content quality with Amazon SageMaker AI"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_f7af8e8908c3d041746c649e4d8687222e4358902c35f25088b969c77f2f795d","internal_url":"/posts/20260228-hacker_news-show-hn-sqlite-for-rivet-actors-one-database-per-a-9/","observation_id":"obs_335e94a0914635a16cbbdf38c0fd20694f0daa6e3b11930fd2fde7d5d4da4a42","published_at":"2026-11-05T17:17:42Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"hacker_news","summary":"当前只保存了来源元数据，未抓取外链全文。请以原始来源和 Hacker News 讨论为准。","title":"Show HN: SQLite for Rivet Actors – one database per agent, tenant, or document"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_6946cf536ab340e76842588cd231fa56c3c087cc3499c2db340bd1952f46e8f6","internal_url":"/posts/20261106-arxiv-a-framework-for-context-enrichment-and-selective-r-0-1ba2bc1e63/","observation_id":"obs_1ba2bc1e6399e93d4fd435a7c22726067a41e0e5dc538d05675de7d9f0122609","published_at":"2026-11-04T18:58:23Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这篇论文研究如何通过有控制地补充提示上下文，减少大语言模型智能体在语义不变改写下行为的波动，同时保持对社会环境变化的合理响应。作者提出“上下文增强”和“选择性稳健性”框架，并在囚徒困境类博弈中进行了验证。","title":"A Framework for Context Enrichment and Selective Robustness in LLM Social Agents"}],"graph_node_id":"tag:AI Agent","id":"tag:AI Agent","related_topics":[{"cooccurrence":5,"graph_node_id":"tag:大语言模型","id":"tag:大语言模型","jaccard":0.5,"topic":"大语言模型"},{"cooccurrence":3,"graph_node_id":"tag:Prompt 工程","id":"tag:Prompt 工程","jaccard":0.3,"t